{:id "0054-lab-marks-polish"
 :title "Lab marks polish: calm styles keep their strength, and the reader stops finding holds in URLs and landings after an ellipsis"
 :lupa/deps #{"0044-lab-marks"}
 :lupa/area :lab
 :lupa/risk :low
 ;; Respecced 2026-11-17 after two REWORK verdicts. The reviewer was right
 ;; twice: no test would fail if the threshold's epsilon were deleted, and
 ;; the foreman's arithmetic in this order was wrong (at Caffeinated the
 ;; threshold computes to 0.29999999999999993, so 0.3 already performed;
 ;; the cases that round up are flourish 0.6 with amount 0.42 and 0.7
 ;; with 0.34). It also showed that the ellipsis rule as first written
 ;; made a landing span a trail-off ('So... yes'), which the design below
 ;; now rules out.
 :goal "Gaps in the foreman's spec for order 0044, found by its reviewer
        and by arithmetic. (1) gesture-for scales a mark's intensity by the
        style's energy, but energy already slows and shrinks motion
        through the style's tempo and amplitude, so a calm style plays
        marks at half strength twice over: Elegant would lift a held word
        about 0.06 em, a third of the Music app's lift that the swell was
        measured from. (2) read finds a :hold in 'www.example.com' and in
        'WWW', 'III' and 'XXX'. (3) An ellipsis ends a sentence, so 'I
        don't know... maybe' lands on 'maybe', though trailing off is the
        opposite of landing. (4) A held letter written with combining
        marks is missed. (5) The performing threshold 0.9 - 0.8 flourish
        can round up (0.42000000000000004 at flourish 0.6), so a mark of
        amount exactly on it (0.42) does not perform."
 :scope ["src/halfahead/lab/marks.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/marks_test.cljc"]
 :design "In halfahead.lab.marks only:
          - gesture-for: intensity is the mark's amount, kept in [0.1 1].
            The style's energy no longer scales it (tempo and amplitude
            already carry energy). The choice of gesture is unchanged.
          - gesture-for: a mark performs when amount >= 0.9 - 0.8
            flourish - 1e-9, so a mark exactly on the threshold performs.
          - read, held letters: a run counts base letters and ignores
            combining marks (U+0300 to U+036F) between them, so 'o' with
            an acute accent three times is a hold. A word is not held when
            it contains '.', '/', '@' or ':' inside it (a URL, a path, an
            address), or when the whole word is the one repeated letter
            ('www', 'III', 'XXX', 'zzz' are not holds; 'sooo' and 'nooo'
            are).
          - read, landing: a last sentence that contains an ellipsis
            ('…' or three or more full stops) anywhere, inside it or at
            its end, has no :land: 'I don't know... maybe', 'It works.
            So... yes.' and 'Done...' do not land. For this purpose an
            ellipsis does not end a sentence (the text after it is the
            same sentence), unless it is followed by '?' or '!'. The
            ellipsis tell itself (:hold on the word before it) is
            unchanged, and lists (:build) still stop at an ellipsis. Say
            in a comment at the call site why landing and builds see
            sentences differently.
          Update the tests that pin the old intensity; add an example for
          each change, including that the acceptance sentence of 0044
          still reads exactly as before; keep every property."
 :acceptance
 ["marks tests updated and extended as in the design, on both hosts"
  "The epsilon is pinned: a mark of amount 0.42 performs at flourish 0.6
   and one of 0.34 at flourish 0.7 (both fail without the 1e-9), and a
   property over flourish f/100 for f from 0 to 100 asserts that a mark
   whose amount is the decimal 0.9 - 0.8 f/100 (computed exactly, in
   thousandths, then as a double) performs"
  "(read \"It works. So... yes.\") has a :hold on 'So' and no :land;
   (read \"one. two...\\nthree\") has no :land"
  "(gesture-for (style/point :elegant) {:span [0 7] :kind :hold :amount
   0.7}) is {:effect :swell :intensity 0.7}"
  "`bb test` stays green"]
 :non-goals
 ["No change to the tells' amounts, the gesture table, dress-for, style
   points or anything outside the two files; do not edit the schema"
  "Do not run `bb e2e`, `bb play` or `bb lab:e2e`"]
 :context ["src/halfahead/lab/marks.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/marks_test.cljc"
           "docs/product/score.md" "DESIGN.md"]
 :budget-usd 6.0}
